**Key results**: 1 critical, 2 high, 3 medium, 4 low severity findings. The critical issue is that `load_toml_dir()` filters on `.toml` extension but battery/ev/generator/loads/water_heating directories contain only CSV files — so all equipment default parameters in those categories are silently unavailable.
